    {"requirement_id": "atomization_abstraction_treatment", "status": "V2R2_PILOT_ROLE_RUN_INTERRUPTED_UNKNOWN_REQUEST_ENDPOINT_MAPPING_OPEN", "evidence": "The extractor abstraction tags remain excluded from scoring. Frozen v1 role qualification remains failed at 12/20 and 14/20 held-out cases. The separate v2r2 synthetic stance/kind/polarity task remains qualified at 20/20 held-out cases in both isolated passes. Its declared 228-request development application retained 69 structurally valid A returns, one A intent without terminal record at unknown disposition, and 158 never-launched requests; B has not begun. The process is absent and the unknown request is quarantined without retry. The raw call inventory is DVC-pushed and hash-bound in the interruption audit. Blind semantic role review, an explicit prospective disposition for uncalled requests, mechanistic/hedged/unresolved endpoint mapping, and response abstraction rank remain open. No support label, endpoint effect, independent confirmation episode, or alpha follows."},
